			<item>
				<title>The $50 Lock That Stops Executive Email Phishing Cold</title>
				<link>http://localhost:3001/reviews/yubikey-5c-nfc/</link>
				<pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:3001/reviews/yubikey-5c-nfc/</guid>
				<description>&lt;aside class=&#34;takeaways&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p class=&#34;takeaways-h&#34;&gt;The 30-second verdict&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;FIDO2/WebAuthn cryptographically binds login to the real site — phishing pages fail.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;USB-C for laptops, NFC tap for phones — works through most cases.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Also handles TOTP, Smart Card and OpenPGP for legacy systems.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Buy two: one on the keychain, one locked in a drawer as backup.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;btn btn-primary&#34; href=&#34;https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Yubico&amp;#43;YubiKey&amp;#43;5C&amp;#43;NFC&amp;#43;security&amp;#43;key&amp;amp;tag=csuitnec-20&amp;amp;linkCode=ll2&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;sponsored nofollow noopener&#34; data-affiliate=&#34;Yubico YubiKey 5C NFC&#34; data-cta=&#34;takeaways&#34;&gt;Check Price on Amazon&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;takeaways-jump&#34; href=&#34;#full-review&#34;&gt;Or read the full breakdown ↓&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &#xA;&lt;/aside&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;why-a-key-beats-an-authenticator-app&#34;&gt;Why a key beats an authenticator app&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A one-time code from an app can still be typed into a fake login page — that&amp;rsquo;s how modern phishing works. A hardware key won&amp;rsquo;t authenticate to the wrong domain, full stop. For an executive whose email is a target, that&amp;rsquo;s the difference. &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Yubico&amp;#43;YubiKey&amp;#43;5C&amp;#43;NFC&amp;#43;security&amp;#43;key&amp;amp;tag=csuitnec-20&amp;amp;linkCode=ll2&#34; class=&#34;out aff&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;sponsored nofollow noopener&#34; data-affiliate=&#34;Yubico YubiKey 5C NFC&#34; data-cta=&#34;in-content&#34;&gt;check the Amazon price&lt;svg class=&#34;out-ico&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;12&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M7 17 17 7M9 7h8v8&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2.5&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and add it to your email and SSO first.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
